            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Features&#xA;â€¢â€‡Glass Passivated Chip Junction&#xA;â€¢â€‡Fast Switching for High Efficiency&#xA;â€¢â€‡High Surge Capacity&#xA;â€¢â€‡Low Forward Voltage: 1.3 V Maximum&#xA;â€¢â€‡UL Flammability 94V-0 Classification&#xA;â€¢â€‡MSL 1 per J-STD-020&#xA;â€¢â€‡RoHS Compliant / Green Molding Compound&#xA;â€¢â€‡Industrial Device Qualified per AEC-Q101 Standards&#xA;â€¢â€‡NRVHP Prefix for Automotive and Other Applications Requiring Unique Site and Control Change Requirements; AEC-Q101 Qualified and PPAP Capable</rdf:li>
